rbi imperdiet velit eu arcu consequat, sit amet tristique enim ultricies. Aenean faucibus dui sit amet elit iaculis iaculis. Nullam volutpat facilisis eros sed commodo.</p>[/content_box][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row=\"\" row_counter=2 page_title=\"\" breadcrumb=\"\" breadcrumb_position=\"inside_content\" id=\"row-161905-2\" sidebar_selection = \"full\" sidebar_id = \"\" paddings = \"\" class=\"row-style-2\" css_class=\"\" parallax_background=\"disabled_parallax\" background_image_url = \"\"][rt_columns][testimonial_carousel id=\"testimonial-carousel-161905-83311\" heading=\"\" heading_icon=\"\" item_width=\"1\" list_orderby=\"date\" list_order=\"DESC\" ids=\"\" style=\"\"][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row=\"\" row_counter=3 page_title=\"\" breadcrumb=\"\" breadcrumb_position=\"inside_content\" id=\"row-161905-33583\" sidebar_selection = \"full\" sidebar_id = \"\" paddings = \"\" class=\"\" css_class=\"\" parallax_background=\"disabled_parallax\" background_image_url = \"\"][rt_columns][rt_column layout=\"two-three\"][heading_bar group_id=\"108624\" content_type=\"heading_bar\" heading=\"TOP FIVE REASONS TO BUY RT-THEME 18\" icon=\"icon-chart-line\" style=\"\" ][text_box id=\"text-box-161905-134188\"]<p>Nam quam nunc, blandit vel, luctus pulvinar, hendrerit id, lorem. Maecenas nec odio et ante tincidunt tempus. Donec vitae sapien ut libero venenatis faucibus. Nullam quis ante. Etiam sit amet orci eget eros faucibus tincidunt.</p>[/text_box][space_box id=\"space-161905-57974\" height=\"20\"][accordion style=\"icons\" first_one_open=\"\"][pane title=\"Template Builder\" icon=\"icon-magic\" ]<p>Template Builder is a built-in tool that lets you create custom page templates to use with your pages or posts. You are free to edit the default templates or create a new one as you wish. Creating custom templates has never been easy like this!</p>[/pane][pane title=\"Mobile &amp; Retina Ready\" icon=\"icon-mobile\" ]<p>RT-Theme 18 has been designed to fit the screens of all popular devices such as tablets, smart phones and regular computers. You can test it by resizing your browser window. Also, it is carefully developed to look sharp with new generation HiDPI /Retina devices.   </p>[/pane][pane title=\"Styling Tools\" icon=\"icon-brush\" ]<p>With extended styling options of RT-Theme you are able to create totally different look for each content section. Please note that all parts of the theme can be re-styled without editing core files. Everything you need is inside the theme options.</p>[/pane][pane title=\" Product Showcase &amp; Portfolio Features\" icon=\"icon-th-list\" ]<p>This is a built-in (plugin free) product catalog page. You can show your products easily by using powerful tools if you don’t need to online shopping features. It also can be used for service presentations such as tour itineraries, events even hotel presentations. The tabs and their icons and order where inside the <a title=\"A sample product page with all elements\" href=\"http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/product-detail/product-name-9/\">products</a> are totally customizable!</p>\r\n<p>By using <a title=\"a sample page for sortable portfolio page \" href=\"http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/our-portfolio-2/\">Portfolio</a> custom post types; you can show your portfolio items easily by using the Template Builder or shortcodes. You can categorize, change layouts and combine with other elements.</p>[/pane][pane title=\"Amazing Theme Options\" icon=\"icon-cog-alt\" ]<p>RT-Framework offers a rock solid theme back-end with tons of useful tools and options. Check the <a title=\"Screenshots from theme options panel of RT-Theme 18\" href=\"http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/admin-panel/\">admin panel screenshots</a> to get more idea..</p>[/pane][/accordion][/rt_column][rt_column layout=\"three\"][blog_carousel id=\"blog-carousel-161905-5958\" crop=\"on\" style=\"plain_carousel\" heading=\"LATEST NEWS\" heading_icon=\"icon-doc-alt\" item_width=\"1\" list_orderby=\"date\" list_order=\"DESC\" max_item=\"4\" categories=\"\" ids=\"\" display_excerpts=\"on\" limit_chars=\"\"][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row]',	'yes'),
